title Cassette OPUS with a 24-character name with spaces (Morning walk with my dog): the info box beside the counter shows the codec (OPUS 48k · 128 kbps) and the time left, never the name; the label holds only the name, up to two lines, no SIDE A, no codec text
sizes 800x480 480x800
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CODEC opus:128
env CASSETTE_DEMO_NAME "Morning walk with my dog"
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LEFT "955 h"
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot name-opus-other
expect esc
@320x480,480x800 expect text "OPUS 48k · 128 kbps"
@320x480,480x800 expect text "955 h left"
@320x480,480x800 expect notext "TAKE 007"
expect notext "SIDE A"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
